{"request_id":"sha256:49825cd6340a314d2933b5df9256317034cc6d72b7e088085aae5afab54a7ba7","units":[{"unit_id":"sha256:ad316ca15a3c67a043ce81f8d66731979112b3a4286fb058c144d21f7084bcb0","reviewed":true,"findings":[{"kind":"CAPACITY_QUALITATIVE","subject":"TARGET_REGISTRANT","timing":"CURRENT_REPORT","evidence":[{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":443}],"reason":"Enphase Energy, Inc. 2025 Form 10-K risk factor lists 'our ability to manage manufacturing capacity and production' as a factor affecting success in new geographic and product markets; qualitative statement about managing manufacturing capacity and production for the registrant's products, no numeric capacity or actual production quantity stated."},{"kind":"CAPACITY_QUALITATIVE","subject":"TARGET_REGISTRANT","timing":"CURRENT_REPORT","evidence":[{"kind":"VISIBLE_BLOCK","source_index":454}],"reason":"Enphase Energy, Inc. 2025 Form 10-K risk factor states that capacity constraints, raw materials shortages, logistics issues, labor shortages and changes in customer requirements, manufacturing facilities or processes have historically caused and may in the future cause reduced manufacturing yields, negatively impacting gross profit and production capacity for those products; also states an increase in rejection and rework rate would result in lower yields, gross profit and production capacity. Qualitative statement about production capacity for the registrant's products; no numeric capacity or actual production quantity stated."}],"unresolved":[],"calculation_limits":["TARGET_CURRENT_PRODUCTION_NOT_PRESENT_IN_THIS_UNIT","TARGET_CURRENT_CAPACITY_NOT_PRESENT_IN_THIS_UNIT","QUANTITIES_NOT_COMPARABLE"]}]}